            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">See what you got done, and undo a misclick.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.35</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Marked a task done or dismissed by mistake? An Undo appears for a few seconds. Click it or press ⌘Z.</li>
  <li>Under your tasks, “Done today” lists what you finished today.</li>
  <li>“All days” opens Your days: pick any day of the past week to see the tasks you closed and the meetings you had, and put any task back on your list.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
